    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"The Aga Khan University draws its faculty, staff and students from all the four provinces which is an excellent example of national integration,\" said Chief Guest Senator Jamiluddin Aali at the Independence Day celebrations at The Aga Khan University (AKU) campus. Commenting on the great natural advantages with which Allah has blessed the nation, Senator Aali said \"Seventeen countries of the world have no access to the sea; eleven countries do not have rivers. While eighty-two countries do not produce sugar, rice or wheat and seventy-eight grow no cotton. With its immense resources Pakistan has all the potential to become the great nation Quaid-e-Azam envisioned. \"",
